// information_schema.columns query (22/9/2026, Supabase MCP). Names + types only: no rows, no data.
// build-schema.mjs turns this into schema.sql for PGlite. Keeping the local schema = production schema is
// what makes "the check SQL runs locally" mean something (catalog query 2 proved 64/64 run in production).
// Views dl_v_rt_gap / pl_v_order_gate become TABLES locally (their definitions are not needed by the checks).
